# Allowlist: exclude everything, then re-include exactly the paths the
# Dockerfile COPYs from the build context. `docker buildx build .` sends the
# whole unignored context to the builder, and this context builds a public base
# image, so a denylist would silently admit any new file dropped in the repo
# root. Adding a COPY means adding its path here.
*

!colcon_ws_config
!docker/entrypoint.sh
!scripts
!excluded-deps.txt
!excluded-pkgs.txt
!spaceros-pkgs.txt
!spaceros.repos
